@base = http://localhost:7071
@token = local-user
@operationId = OPERATION_ID

### Health includes matching
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Compute a single pair (sync)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/matches/compute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resumeText": "Staff engineer Python Azure Cosmos Functions Kubernetes Terraform",
  "jobText": "Title: Platform Engineer\nSkills: python azure cosmos kubernetes\nShip services on Azure.",
  "threshold": 70,
  "explanation": true
}

### Rank several jobs (N<=10 sync; N>10 returns 202)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/matches/rank
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resumeText": "Staff engineer Python Azure Cosmos Functions Kubernetes Terraform",
  "jobIds": ["job-a", "job-b"],
  "jobTexts": [
    "Title: Platform Engineer\nSkills: python azure cosmos kubernetes",
    "Title: Baker\nSkills: frosting pastry whisk"
  ],
  "threshold": 70,
  "explanation": true
}

### Poll an async rank/compute operation
GET {{base}}/api/v1/operations/{{operationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel a queued operation
POST {{base}}/api/v1/operations/{{operationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List persisted match results (scores at or above threshold)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/match-results?minScore=70&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Review match queue is a different route (GET /v1/matches)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/matches?status=pending&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
